[52.053201, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[52.054019, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe default `/usr/local/bin/python3` (3.13.1) has a `pip` launcher but its `pip` module is missing. Let me inspect the Python installation, site-packages, and \r\nwhether `ensurepip` is available before deciding how to restore it.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x\r\nhead -n 10 /usr/local/bin/pip3; ls -l /usr/local/bin/pip*\r\npython3 -c 'import sys, site; print(sys.executable); print(sys.prefix); print(\"sitepackages:\"); print(*sys.path, sep=\"\\n\"); print(\"site dirs:\", \r\nsite.getsitepackages())'\r\necho '--- ensurepip ---'\r\npython3 -m ensurepip --version; echo rc=$?\r\necho '--- dirs ---'\r\nls -la /usr/local/lib/python3.13/ 2>&1 | head -50\r\nls -la /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/ 2>&1 | head -100\r\necho '--- system python ---'\r\n/usr/bin/python3 --version; /usr/bin/python3 -c 'import sys; print(sys.prefix)'; /usr/bin/python3 -m pip --version 2>&1 || true\r\necho '--- commands/interpreters ---'\r\nls -l /usr/local/bin/python* /usr/bin/python3* 2>&1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[52.055746, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[52.330924, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[52.33347, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n+ head -n 10 /usr/local/bin/pip3\r\n#!/usr/local/bin/python3.13\r\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\r\nimport re\r\nimport sys\r\nfrom pip._internal.cli.main import main\r\nif __name__ == '__main__':\r\n    sys.argv[0] = re.sub(r'(-script\\.pyw|\\.exe)?$', '', sys.argv[0])\r\n    sys.exit(main())\r\n+ ls -l /usr/local/bin/pip /usr/local/bin/pip3 /usr/local/bin/pip3.13\r\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   4 Jan 14  2025 /usr/local/bin/pip -> pip3\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 230 Jan 14  2025 /usr/local/bin/pip3\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 230 Jan 14  2025 /usr/local/bin/pip3.13\r\n+ python3 -c import sys, site; print(sys.executable); print(sys.prefix); print(\"sitepackages:\"); print(*sys.path, sep=\"\\n\"); print(\"site dirs:\", \r\nsite.getsitepackages())\r\n/usr/local/bin/python3\r\n/usr/local\r\nsitepackages:\r\n\r\n/usr/local/lib/python313.zip\r\n/usr/local/lib/python3.13\r\n/usr/local/lib/python3.13/lib-dynload\r\n/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages\r\nsite dirs: ['/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages']\r\n+ echo --- ensurepip ---\r\n--- ensurepip ---"]
