[55.782131, "o", "\r\u001b[2K`ensurepip` is bundled and reports pip 24.3.1, while `/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages` contains only `pip-24.3.1.dist-info` and no actual `pip/` \r\npackage. This indicates the pip module files were removed/incompletely installed. I’ll restore pip system-wide with `ensurepip`, then verify with an install.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x\r\npython3 -m ensurepip --upgrade\r\necho \"ensurepip rc=$?\"\r\npython3 -m pip --version\r\npip --version\r\npython3 -c 'import pip; print(pip.__file__)'\r\nls -la /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/ | head -30\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[55.782619, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[56.611783, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
