[64.728246, "o", "\r\u001b[2K`ensurepip --upgrade` incorrectly treats the orphaned `pip-24.3.1.dist-info` metadata as a completed installation, so it skips extracting the bundled pip wheel.\r\nI’ll remove that stale metadata and rerun ensurepip. The bundled wheel is present, so no network is needed.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x\r\nls -la /usr/local/lib/python3.13/ensurepip/_bundled/\r\nrm -rf /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pip-24.3.1.dist-info\r\npython3 -m ensurepip --upgrade\r\nrc=$?\r\necho \"ensurepip rc=$rc\"\r\npython3 -m pip --version\r\npip --version\r\npython3 -c 'import pip; print(pip.__file__)'\r\nls -la /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/ | head -30\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
