[82.038365, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe install/import/show/uninstall cycle succeeded through `python3 -m pip`. As a final edge-case check, I’ll exercise the standalone `pip`, `pip3`, and \r\n`pip3.13` launchers and the `python` symlink, then confirm the package directories are clean.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nfor cmd in pip pip3 pip3.13; do echo \"--- $cmd ---\"; command -v \"$cmd\"; \"$cmd\" --version; done\r\necho '--- python -m pip ---'\r\npython -m pip --version\r\necho '--- standalone pip real install ---'\r\npip install --no-index --force-reinstall --no-deps /tmp/pip_fix_probe-1.0-py3-none-any.whl\r\npython3 -c 'import pip_fix_probe; assert pip_fix_probe.__version__ == \"1.0\"'\r\npip uninstall -y pip_fix_probe\r\npython3 -m pip check\r\necho '--- leftover probe artifacts ---'\r\nfind /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages -maxdepth 1 -iname '*probe*' -print\r\necho 'PIP_RESTORE_VERIFIED'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
